  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_07dfb5279e2e426795d35102c70cfe08",
      "statement": "celld tests three promises — an acknowledged write is durable, a cell has one writer at a time, and Cloudflare Workers code operates the same — across four layers: differential conformance, model checking, deterministic simulation, and fault injection on live fleets.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/testing.md#L3-L15",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c35dfb12c74927175e44471c13a51bc7a04cea4711aceddc62702469c215749e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_43fe076ed35e4cc9b63152137a7d35a8",
      "statement": "The compatibility promise is tested differentially: each Workers and Durable Objects program runs once on workerd and once on celld on identical bytes, the outputs must be equal, and the corpus grows with fixtures for each new API surface.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/testing.md#L17-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c47ebc43b502e7d92c50b8d493c59cf3110c8d81f1102c59d3885328338e5900:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1ac26cd7f1324a89a48e9f4ab63e33ed",
      "statement": "The coordination protocol is specified in TLA+; the model checker found four bugs and a split-brain that lost an acknowledged write, all fixed, and at small configuration the checker enumerates every reachable state with a linearizable store and perfect clocks so a violation needs no clock skew or storage anomaly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/testing.md#L35-L52",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2aee6e26265c6c112ce43a1422547b2ba915377c81e7fd87a34e4eede912b7ae:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fe06999b04534913a3f3f1367d1506fe",
      "statement": "Every TLA+ configuration carries a pinned expected verdict, most of them failures modeling past bugs, and a configuration that stops failing has lost its tooth; the specifications are a hand-synced snapshot deliberately not in continuous integration.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/testing.md#L53-L79",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2cf281c23ad18a500694ce4571d3b30eb0db62ab95b49186d62f98e1245417aa:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d8ecd68590f544bb902e8b66edb443de",
      "statement": "The coordination protocol is a pure decision core: on_event is the only way behavioral state advances, the production executor and deterministic simulator both feed it events and perform the returned effects, and no adapter may mutate State directly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/logic/lib.rs#L3-L7",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d17ba561785ca7348bb778cc922706279fc2c8177e57be65f95ad2d2ff6c06b8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9b1cac4ddf594a0199eea50df32dc607",
      "statement": "The simulator drives the decision core with a store that injects latency, compare-and-swap races, and lost responses; clocks drift apart; a node can crash at each await point; and V8 stays out of the simulation because it is not deterministic.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/testing.md#L88-L95",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4891ee0459d034af26f1745d0b6efa6be1abec109dfffe38798783b0aa9ea46b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_60a05f1d31524daeaffee86722c932ce",
      "statement": "A seeded scheduler drives each simulation run so a failure replays exactly, properties are examined for safety and liveness, and each property must survive tens of thousands of seeds.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/testing.md#L96-L103",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:08d29c88cf4a167262f670aaef280e55f9a895df0caf1c1a73523caab88eb857:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b6e6a623ea5745edad034591dca28391",
      "statement": "The checkers are tested with deliberately broken protocol variants, because a suite that stays green against a broken protocol is a broken suite.",
      "evidence": [
