    {
      "id": "claim_291871af8d0a4afa9593a5231d5160e7",
      "statement": "The live-fleet lab runs standard VMs and a real bucket with rotating workloads, archives an evidence bundle per run, keeps red runs with the same care as green runs, and injects faults between verification passes that compare each cell's durable state exactly.",
