    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c0c83e62527540edad03bd52e6cc0475",
      "statement": "The live-fleet scenarios include SIGKILL mid-write-stream with the local database deleted, freezing an owner and writing through other nodes, cutting a node off from the bucket, throttling the bucket with 429s, and stopping a full host; across every run no acknowledged write was lost and no committed state was damaged.",
      "evidence": [
